.TH SDL_RequestOpenHarmonyPermissionCallback 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_RequestOpenHarmonyPermissionCallback \- Callback that presents
.BR SDL_RequestOpenHarmonyPermission ()
results.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_system.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef void (SDLCALL *SDL_RequestOpenHarmonyPermissionCallback)(void *userdata, const char *permission, bool granted);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I userdata
an app-controlled pointer that is passed to the callback\[char46]
.TP
.I permission
the OpenHarmony-specific permission name that was requested\[char46]
.TP
.I granted
true if permission is granted, false if denied\[char46]
.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_RequestOpenHarmonyPermission (3)
